    rdfs:label "Earth Spirit: MAGICAL_DAMAGE = 1.0"^^xsd:string ;
    kg:evidence "ability Boulder Smash damage code = 2; Earth Spirit smashes the target enemy or ally, sending them in the direction he is facing. If Earth Spirit targets an area, he will smash the nearest unit in a %remnant_smash_radius_tooltip% radius, prioritizing Stone Remnants. The travelling unit or Remnant damages all enemy units it hits. If an enemy is hit by a Stone Remnant, they are also slowed. Stone Remnants travel further than other units."^^xsd:string ;
