    kg:evidence "ability Roll Up: Pangolier curls into an immobile protective ball, gaining debuff immunity, %magic_resistance%%% magic resistance, and allowing him to turn. Can be cast during Rolling Thunder to temporarily hit the brakes. Can cast Rolling Thunder and Shield Crash during Roll Up. If enemies attack Pangolier during this, he will roll away from the attacker, applying Rolling Thunder damage/stun if there are enemies in the way."^^xsd:string ;
    kg:feature <https://github.com/vladlenblch/dota2-counterpick-knowledge-graph/resource/feature/DEBUFF_IMMUNITY> ;
