    kg:evidence "ability Trample: Primal Beast stomps over everything. For every %step_distance% units traveled, all enemies around the Beast receive damage. Deals base damage plus a multiplier of Primal Beast's attack damage. Primal Beast is disarmed for the duration of the ability.; radius = 200.0; damage code = 2"^^xsd:string ;
