    rdfs:label "Muerta: AOE_DAMAGE = 1.0"^^xsd:string ;
    kg:evidence "ability Dead Shot: Muerta fires a ghostly trickshot at an enemy unit or tree. When the bullet strikes, it damages and briefly slows, then ricochets in the targeted direction. The ricochet damages all units that it passes through, stopping when it hits a hero. Heroes hit by the ricochet are feared away from the impact.; radius = 150.0; damage code = 2"^^xsd:string ;
    kg:feature <https://github.com/vladlenblch/dota2-counterpick-knowledge-graph/resource/feature/AOE_DAMAGE> ;
