    rdfs:label "Faceless Void: MAGICAL_DAMAGE = 1.0"^^xsd:string ;
    kg:evidence "ability Time Dilation damage code = 2; Faceless Void envelops nearby enemies with time dilating fields to slow cooldown progression of their abilities. Each enveloped enemy gains one Time Dilation stack when applied, and one stack per ability they have on cooldown. Each stack deals damage per second and slows movement and attack speed. The duration is paused while affected by Chronosphere."^^xsd:string ;
    kg:feature <https://github.com/vladlenblch/dota2-counterpick-knowledge-graph/resource/feature/MAGICAL_DAMAGE> ;
